	"TagLine": "Export a screenshot of locations from the SMAPI console.",
	"Description": "**This mod is no longer maintained and may not work in newer game versions.**\nThere's now an equivalent feature in the base game. Just scroll to the bottom of the in-game options menu and click the screenshot button.\n\n<s>This mod allows you to export an image of any game location into a PNG.\n\nFrom the SMAPI console, type 'export help'. This will give you the commands and settings available.\n\nThe resulting images are stored in 'MapExports/MAP_NAME.png'.</s>",
